# v296 — OPERATIONS NAVIGATION REGISTRATION
# Application-only: two registry rows in the sidebar. No SQL object.
#
# It still carries a manifest, and that is the point. v296 made the v294 and
# v292e surfaces REACHABLE from the rail — turning a URL-only surface into one
# an operator can click. A release that ships no SQL can still be the release
# that exposes an undeployed database band to users, so its prerequisite is the
# whole chain beneath it.
release          v296
migration
migration_source none
min_release      v295
